# Panel (Angular) Conventions

## Jalali Dates

Always use `jalali-moment` for date display — never raw `Date` or `toLocaleDateString`:

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
new Date(ts).toLocaleDateString('fa-IR')

// ✅ GOOD
import jalaliMoment from 'jalali-moment';
jalaliMoment(ts).locale('fa').format('jYYYY/jMM/jDD')
```

## RxJS — Unsubscribe

Use `takeUntilDestroyed()` (Angular 16+) — never manage subscriptions manually:

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
private destroy$ = new Subject<void>();
ngOnDestroy() { this.destroy$.next(); }
obs$.pipe(takeUntil(this.destroy$)).subscribe(...)

// ✅ GOOD
import { takeUntilDestroyed } from '@angular/core/rxjs-interop';
obs$.pipe(takeUntilDestroyed()).subscribe(...)
```

## Naming

- Component files: `kebab-case.component.ts`
- Component classes: `PascalCaseComponent`
- Services: `PascalCaseService` in `kebab-case.service.ts`
- Avoid `any` — type API responses with interfaces

## HTTP Calls

All backend calls go through a typed service — never call `HttpClient` directly from a component.
